    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small cosy game about building model buildings on a stand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to create, tweak, and save your own buildings  and set the mood by picking the time of day and your favourite spot on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a little toy, no goals, winning or speed runs for now.<br><br>Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favourite spot and start building.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the time of day to the time and direction you prefer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the cosy glow of windows at night.</p></li></ul>",
